  "title": "New Investment To Support The Future Of Prague’s Leading Live Venues",
  "summary": "Live Nation has signed an agreement to acquire a majority stake in three of Prague’s leading live entertainment venues, marking the beginning of a new chapter for O2 arena (20,000-capacity), O2 Universum (5,000-capacity) and Forum Karlín (4,000-capacity). The deal will create new opportunities for artists, audiences, event organisers and the wider economy.…",
